[[File:Debug-scenario.png|thumb|300px|UI of the debug scenario list]]
'''Debug scenarios''' are a list of predefined save states which can be launched from the main menu when in [[debug mode]].  Each scenarios have a set of conditions and settings which can be used to quickly setup the save state. Every scenarios are stored inside the global table <code>debugScenarios</code> (client side only), defined from the Lua files stored inside <code>media/lua/client/DebugUIs/Scenarios</code>, which means you can create your own debug scenarios.

== Available scenarios ==
